1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,453
Hello Priya, this is your uncle speaking.

2
00:00:03,453 --> 00:00:07,747
I'm calling about the family gathering
next Sunday.

3
00:00:07,747 --> 00:00:14,737
We'll all meet at the temple at 9 AM and
after prayers, lunch will be at our house.

4
00:00:14,737 --> 00:00:20,968
Tell my mother to bring the sweets she
makes; everyone is asking for them.

5
00:00:20,968 --> 00:00:25,600
Your cousin Ravi is coming from Pune on
Saturday night.

6
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:30,551
So, someone has to pick him up from the
station at eleven o'clock.

7
00:00:30,551 --> 00:00:34,827
I asked your father, but he has a meeting,
so can you go?

8
00:00:34,827 --> 00:00:39,177
The train is Deccan Express, and hall
booking is also done

9
00:00:39,177 --> 00:00:42,853
and I have given five thousand rupees in
advance.

10
00:00:42,853 --> 00:00:46,304
We still have to decide about the
decorations.

11
00:00:46,304 --> 00:00:51,630
Your aunt wants marigolds, but I think
roses would be better this time.

12
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:52,980
What do you think?

13
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:58,727
Tell me, Grandma is very happy that
everyone is coming together after so long.

14
00:00:58,727 --> 00:01:04,473
She keeps saying that it's been three
years since the whole family came to one

15
00:01:04,473 --> 00:01:10,662
place. Another thing, the photographer
wants to know how many people will be
coming.

16
00:01:10,662 --> 00:01:13,093
I think there will be about forty

17
00:01:13,093 --> 00:01:18,840
but please confirm on your end and don't
forget to bring the old photo albums.

18
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:21,441
Grandma wants to show the kids.

19
00:01:21,441 --> 00:01:26,810
If it rains, we'll have lunch inside, so
don't worry about that.

20
00:01:26,810 --> 00:01:32,263
I'll send you the address of the hall
later today over the phone.

21
00:01:32,263 --> 00:01:37,968
Call me back when you get this message.
Any time after 6 PM is fine.

22
00:01:37,968 --> 00:01:42,330
Take care and give my blessings to
everyone at home.
